  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add minced garlic and sauté for about 1 minute until fragrant but not browned.",
    "Stir in Thai rice pearls, orange juice, salt, pepper, and coconut milk.",
    "Simmer for 5 minutes or until liquid is absorbed by the pearls.",
    "Sprinkle binchotan-charcoal powder on top of the mixture and stir gently to distribute evenly.",
    "Serve hot as a side dish or over greens."
